app.vulkan.no_loader = schist: nta mutangizi wa Vulkan uri kuri iyi sisitemu, bityo nta buryo bwo gushushanya buhari.\n\nSchist ishushanya ikoresheje Vulkan, kandi `libvulkan.so.1` ntishyizwemo.\nUmutangizi na porogaramu nyobozi birakenewe byombi:\n\n    Arch, CachyOS, Omarchy    sudo pacman -S vulkan-icd-loader vulkan-driver\n    Debian, Ubuntu, Mint      sudo apt install libvulkan1 mesa-vulkan-drivers\n    Fedora, RHEL              sudo dnf install vulkan-loader mesa-vulkan-drivers\n
app.vulkan.override_missing = schist: porogaramu nyobozi ya Vulkan iri gukoreshwa n'iki gikorwa ntiboneka.\n\n{var} yashyizweho, kandi kuyishyiraho *bisimbura* uburyo umutangizi ashakisha\nporogaramu nyobozi aho kubwongeraho. Bityo aya madosiye atabaho\nni yo rutonde rwose rwa porogaramu nyobozi -- kandi buri porogaramu ya Vulkan\nmuri iki gikorwa nta porogaramu nyobozi ibona, nubwo haba hashyizwemo nyinshi:\n\n{missing}\n    {var}={value}\n\nYerekeze kuri manifeste ibaho -- porogaramu nyobozi zashyizwemo zibika izazo muri\n/usr/share/vulkan/icd.d -- cyangwa uyikureho ureke umutangizi yishakire.\nIgikorwa gishyiraho ibi kivanye mu idosiye y'igenamiterere (`env =` ya Hyprland,\nidosiye ya systemd environment.d, umwirondoro wa shell) kigomba kubihindurirwamo,\nkandi bisaba kongera kwinjira kugira ngo impinduka zigere ku bisanzwe biri gukora.\n
app.vulkan.override_note = \n{var} yashyizwe kuri {value}, kandi ibyo bisimbura uburyo umutangizi\nyishakiramo: niba nta n'imwe muri izo manifeste igenewe iyi mashini, kuyikuraho\nni cyo cya mbere cyo kugerageza.\n
app.vulkan.no_driver = schist: nta porogaramu nyobozi ya Vulkan yashyizwemo, bityo nta buryo bwo gushushanya buhari.\n\nSchist ishushanya ikoresheje Vulkan. Umutangizi yarashyizwemo ariko avuga ko nta\nporogaramu nyobozi ihari -- nta n'imwe yiyandikishije muri hamwe muri aha hombi ishakirwa:\n\n{dirs}\n\nUmutangizi utangwa ukwawo utandukanye na porogaramu nyobozi, bityo akenshi\nhabura paketi imwe gusa.\n\nShyiramo igenewe GPU y'iyi mashini:\n\n    Arch, CachyOS, Omarchy    sudo pacman -S vulkan-driver\n    Debian, Ubuntu, Mint      sudo apt install mesa-vulkan-drivers\n    Fedora, RHEL              sudo dnf install mesa-vulkan-drivers\n\nPorogaramu nyobozi ya NVIDIA ni umutungo bwite wayo kandi yitwaza iyayo (`nvidia-utils` kuri Arch,\n`nvidia-driver` kuri Debian). Muri mashini yigana, cyangwa ahandi hose hatagira\nporogaramu nyobozi ya GPU yo gushyiramo, igishushanya cya porogaramu ni cyo gikora:\n`vulkan-swrast` kuri Arch, kikaba igice cya `mesa-vulkan-drivers` ahandi. Kiratinda,\nariko kiratangira.\n{overridden}
app.vulkan.no_device = schist: porogaramu nyobozi ya Vulkan yarashyizwemo ariko nta gikoresho cyo gushushanyaho itanga.\n\nPorogaramu nyobozi ishobora kuba itagenewe iyi GPU, cyangwa idashobora kuyigeraho --\nukoresheje SSH, cyangwa uri muri kontineri, /dev/dri akenshi ni cyo kiba\nkibura. `vulkaninfo --summary` ivuga ibyo umutangizi ubona.\n\nIgishushanya cya porogaramu gishushanya nta GPU n'imwe, niba ari uko\niyi mashini imeze: `vulkan-swrast` kuri Arch, kikaba igice cya `mesa-vulkan-drivers`\nkuri Debian na Fedora.\n
app.vulkan.skip_hint = Kugira ngo utangize Schist uko byagenda kose maze ireke inanirwe mu buryo bwayo, shyiraho {var}=1.
